                  "bare": false,
                  "muted": true,
                  "items": [
                    "Built a modular ruler system as a standalone React component, powered by PixiJS for real-time Canvas/WebGL interactions. Enabled intuitive manipulation such as dragging and rotating via pointer events, supported by geometric computation and state-machine logic for precise node snapping and structural attachment.",
                    "Developed a set of ruler modules in different sizes and forms, allowing users to freely disassemble and recombine them into flexible geometric structures through a unified interaction rule system."
                  ]
                }
              ]
